{"type":"text","timestamp":1794348895138,"sessionID":"ses_e388961eaffeiZr8Qz2wf5T8Hw","part":{"id":"prt_1c7874b86001XpArIRNg9v66Ge","messageID":"msg_1c7871ff4001pQmYNuQlzhsLjX","sessionID":"ses_e388961eaffeiZr8Qz2wf5T8Hw","type":"text","text":"Done. Summary of the implementation:\n\n**Backend** (`backend/app.py`, stdlib + Flask only — no new deps, lockfile intact):\n- SQLite at `./data/notifications.db` (WAL), schema created lazily per worker with conflict-safe admin bootstrap.\n- Auth: `register` (201, 409 dup, 400 invalid), `login` → bearer token (`secrets.token_hex`, stored in `tokens`); `GET /api/auth/me` for session restore. Admin password read from `ADMIN_PASSWORD` at start; unset/empty stores an impossible hash so admin sign-in is disabled; hash rewrite (and token invalidation) only when the password actually changes, so restarts keep sessions.\n- Notifications: paged `GET` (newest first, `read`/`type`/`page`/`page_size`, `unread_count` ignores filters), `POST` (defaults to `general`), `read-all` → `updated`, `GET`/`PATCH`/`DELETE` by id — ownership enforced, other users' items 404. Broadcast is admin-only, inserts into every inbox and returns `delivered`. JSON errors on `/api/*`; SPA fallback serves `frontend/dist`.\n\n**Frontend** (Vite + React 19 + TS + Tailwind v4 via `@tailwindcss/vite`, single `@import` entry css): auth register/sign-in card, header bell with unread badge, username + sign-out, add-notification form, admin broadcast form, filters (read/type), mark-all-read, per-item read/unread toggle + delete, paging, type badges, unread bold.\n\nVerified with 25 API/frontend integration checks (all pass, incl. 2-worker gunicorn), `tsc --noEmit`, and a clean `npm ci && npm run build` matching the Dockerfile.","time":{"start":1794348895110,"end":1794348895114}}}
